From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ps5cemu <ps5cemu@localhost>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 23:28:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PS5: a frontend's overlay over the screens

The PS5 frontend draws its in-game menu over the 3DS's screens, in the
renderer's own frame: SetFrontendOverlay gives a function the device and
the command buffer twice a frame, before the screens' render pass begins
(for uploads) and in it, after the screens and the cursor.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/video_core/CMakeLists.txt                 |  1 +
 .../renderer_vulkan/renderer_vulkan.cpp       | 41 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../renderer_vulkan/renderer_vulkan.h         |  5 +++
 .../renderer_vulkan/vk_frontend_overlay.h     | 38 +++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 85 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_frontend_overlay.h

diff --git a/src/video_core/CMakeLists.txt b/src/video_core/CMakeLists.txt
